<title>USA: Revere adjusts copper, zinc base prices.</title>
<headline>Revere adjusts copper, zinc base prices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revere Copper Products adjusted the published base prices for its brass mill products to reflect a two-cent decline in copper prices to $1.24 a lb and a seven-cent increase in zinc prices to 92 cents a lb.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
